 644:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** /*********************************************************************
 645:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 646:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *       SEGGER_RTT_WriteSkipNoLock
 647:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 648:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
 649:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Stores a specified number of characters in SEGGER RTT
 650:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    control block which is then read by the host.
 651:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    SEGGER_RTT_WriteSkipNoLock does not lock the application and
 652:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    skips all data, if the data does not fit into the buffer.
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccRQNo80.s 			page 33


 653:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 654:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
 655:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of "Up"-buffer to be used (e.g. 0 for "Terminal").
 656:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to character array. Does not need to point to a \0 terminated string.
 657:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    NumBytes     Number of bytes to be stored in the SEGGER RTT control block.
 658:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 659:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Return value
 660:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Number of bytes which have been stored in the "Up"-buffer.
 661:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 662:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Notes
 663:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (1) If there is not enough space in the "Up"-buffer, all data is dropped.
 664:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (2) For performance reasons this function does not call Init()
 665:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *        and may only be called after RTT has been initialized.
 666:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *        Either by calling SEGGER_RTT_Init() or calling another RTT API function first.
 667:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
